Subject: [PATCH 32/34] configs: add imx943 basic cells for FreeRTOS and Zephyr

Signed-off-by: Hou Zhiqiang <Zhiqiang.Hou@nxp.com>
Upstream-Status: Pending
---
 configs/arm64/imx943-hmc-freertos.c | 59 +++++++++++++++++++
